**To download a pull request (or a "PR") you need to:**
**1.** Make sure you are signed in with a GitHub account
**2.** Follow the pull request link that was sent to you (for example https://github.com/GeyserMC/Geyser/pull/699)
**3.** Follow the guide on this picture
